    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d734">

                <pb facs="0887" n="799" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg799"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">411.12/1596: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Daniels</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-01T10:00:00-06:00">May 1, 1933—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:24 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>85. I called on the Minister of Foreign Affairs Saturday afternoon and told him
                    that I had read his memorandum (see my telegram 73, April 22, noon)<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="d734-f1"/> and that I was heartily in accordance with his view that
                    an en bloc settlement is desirable.</p>
                <p>Dr. Puig said that Mr. Pani<anchor n="9" xml:id="d734-f2"/> did not expect to
                    initiate en bloc negotiations in Washington but would be prepared to stress the
                    discussion of economic and monetary matters. He said that he was preparing a
                    memorandum giving his concrete proposals for an en bloc adjustment <pb
                        facs="0888" n="800" xml:id="pg800"/> which he would present to me sometime
                    next week. I am sending a full report of my conversation with Dr. Puig by the
                    next pouch.</p>
                <p>I believe that it would be unwise for the Department to enter into discussion
                    with Mr. Pani on en bloc settlement until after Dr. Puig presents his promised
                    suggestion of a means of arriving at such settlement and you receive my
                    recommendation after study of Puig’s forthcoming memorandum.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniels</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
